#: 0047c4cec43641e9bc30aafc2ab02338
msgid "**DroneCore.Pilot** is based on Cube Orange - the widely used autopilot by CubePilot running on ArduPilot (or optionally PX4 flight stack) and Nvidia Jetson Xavier NX. Their rich interfaces allow connecting most sensors and other peripherals for drones available on the market."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-airvolute-DroneCore-Suite.rst:116
#: 4117971d6300429eb1c3b4bc5da7b6de
msgid "**DroneCore.Power** contains 4 FOC DroneCAN ESCs with motor identification feature able to be configured for all common BLDC/PMSM drone motors on the market and a telemetry interface providing real time data to the autopilot. Furthermore it provides battery voltage and current measurements as well as individual cell voltages."
msgstr ""

